<urn:atm:triage:finding/S12-QA1-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "S12-QA1-001" ;
  triage:title "INTG-RBP-001/002 recovery text differs from canonical triage spec — cross-doc conflict (BP-ECR-002)" ;
  triage:description "runtime_health.rs:697 and :719: The canonical triage records INTG-RBP-001 and INTG-RBP-002 (labeled 'canonical finding records' in sprint-S12.md:70) specify operator-actionable .with_recovery() strings. INTG-RBP-001 canonical: 'Remove or rename the malformed team directory under the ATM teams root before retrying.' Implemented: 'ensure team name is valid UTF-8'. INTG-RBP-002 canonical: 'Repair or remove the malformed team config file and restart atm-daemon or send SIGHUP.' Implemented: 'check atm message format'. The shorter strings do not satisfy requirements.md BP-ECR-002 ('operator-actionable failures still exist without .with_recovery() guidance') because they state what to fix but not how. Fix: update runtime_health.rs recovery strings to match canonical triage record text, OR update triage records and explain the shorter text rationale." ;
  triage:category "REQ" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-S" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
